  "conclusion": "Claude 2.1.300 warns on a regular CLAUDE.md at a plugin root, including an empty file. Moving identical project guidance to the documented .claude/CLAUDE.md location and retargeting AGENTS.md resolves the root warning without changing manifests, strict mode, or guidance content. A root CLAUDE.md symlink also evades the warning but is not the selected repair.",
